EXPERIMENT 1: GOOGLE DORKS + NEWS VERIFICATION
============================================================

A) PRACTICAL PERFORMANCE

TOOL:
Google Search — https://www.google.com

EXAMPLE TOPIC:
Prakash Raj case filed over Chandrayaan-3 post.

SEARCH QUERIES — 8 TYPES:

1. Search a website:
site:ndtv.com

2. Search a specific website and topic:
