STEPS:
1. Open Google.
2. Enter the required dork/query.
3. Open relevant results.
4. Record title, URL, publisher and date.
5. Compare reports from independent news sources.
6. Check official or primary sources where available.
7. Record verified facts and any uncertainty.

NEWS VERIFICATION LINKS:
NDTV:
https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/case-filed-against-actor-prakash-raj-for-mocking-chandrayaan-3-4318361

India Today:
